        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "商店街で買い物したらクジもらって。\nゾロ目なら当たりなんだけど……。",
            "enText": "I got a free scratch-off raffle ticket while I was \nout shopping. You know the kind — find three\nof the same number, win a prize…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -990064143465346197,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "削って出たのが――\r\n『7』『7』…………『3』",
            "enText": "So I tried my luck, and guess what numbers \nI got? Seven, seven… three.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 7624432965834938831,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "はははー……ゾロ目って、\nもしや都市伝説？",
            "enText": "Ahaha… I wonder if anyone \nactually wins those things.",
